00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,419
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,419 --> 00:00:06,822
Never write that the lagging strand is made three prime to five prime.

3
00:00:06,822 --> 00:00:14,791
Every piece of new DNA, including every Okazaki fragment, is made five prime to three prime.

4
00:00:14,791 --> 00:00:19,596
Only the overall growth of the lagging strand runs away from the fork.

